<title>JAPAN: Maruei -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Maruei -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    32.84		vs	   33.87</p>
<p> Operating	  144    million	  vs	  106    million</p>
<p> Current	    351    million	  vs	  306    million</p>
<p> Net		  178    million	  vs	  165    million</p>
<p> EPS		    3.64 yen	  vs	    3.35 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     49 million	  vs	  49 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.25 yen	  vs	    3.25 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Maruei Department Store Co Ltd is a Nagoya-based department store chain.</p>
</text>
